        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 30.833,
          "end": 35.233,
          "en": "We can do this from vuejs.org and on this page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 35.233,
          "end": 38.4,
          "en": "there is this \"Install\" link on which you can click,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 38.966,
          "end": 41.133,
          "en": "which takes you to the official documentation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 41.4,
          "end": 44.966,
          "en": "where you find instructions on how to create a Vue project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 45.733,
          "end": 49,
          "en": "By the way, in general, the official documentation is really good.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 49.233,
          "end": 53.366,
          "en": "So in addition to taking this course, I can only recommend that you also dive",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 53.366,
          "end": 57.133,
          "en": "into the official documentation after going through this course",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 57.366,
          "end": 60.166,
          "en": "to dove deeper or refresh certain concepts.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 60.5,
          "end": 63.833,
          "en": "But when it comes to setting up a project and getting started,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 64.1,
          "end": 66.233,
          "en": "we're here in the quick start section",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 66.233,
          "end": 69.4,
          "en": "and you find different ways of creating a Vue project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 69.766,
          "end": 73.133,
          "en": "We will learn about different ways throughout this course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 73.4,
          "end": 78.5,
          "en": "but the easiest way is not to install packages, as it's mentioned up here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 78.533,
          "end": 82.533,
          "en": "We will do this later, but instead the easiest way to get started",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 82.8,
          "end": 86.333,
          "en": "is by simply adding an import to the Vue package",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 86.333,
          "end": 88.93299999999999,
          "en": "from a CDN to your page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 89.6,
          "end": 92.5,
          "en": "And for this, we can grab this script tag here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 92.5,
          "end": 97.4,
          "en": "which you find in the without built tools section and copy that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 98.733,
          "end": 99.9,
          "en": "And then with this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 99.9,
          "end": 103.666,
          "en": "copied we add this into our index.html file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 103.96600000000001,
          "end": 106.8,
          "en": "and you should make sure that the link here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 106.8,
          "end": 109.6,
          "en": "- this import link - ends with vue@3",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 110.866,
          "end": 115.5,
          "en": "or vue@next, which also gives you version 3.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 115.76599999999999,
          "end": 116.066,
          "en": "So let's grab that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 116.066,
          "end": 120.733,
          "en": "go to index HTML and add that before your script here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 120.733,
          "end": 124.3,
          "en": "So before we execute app.js,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 124.3,
          "end": 129.3,
          "en": "add this script with the Vue CDN above your own script.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 130.566,
          "end": 133.8,
          "en": "That will your script allow to use Vue.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 133.8,
          "end": 136.7,
          "en": "So now let's save this file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 136.7,
          "end": 139.166,
          "en": "In app.js we can use Vue.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 139.166,
          "end": 142.133,
          "en": "And now what does use Vue mean?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 142.133,
          "end": 145.733,
          "en": "With Vue, we can solve the same problem,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 145.733,
          "end": 147.233,
          "en": "if you wanna call it like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 147.233,
          "end": 149.4,
          "en": "in a totally different way.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 149.4,
          "end": 151.433,
          "en": "In regular Java script,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 151.433,
          "end": 152.86599999999999,
          "en": "which we used before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 152.86599999999999,
          "end": 155.5,
          "en": "we used a so-called imperative approach.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 155.5,
          "end": 159.7,
          "en": "Which means we define every single step,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 159.7,
          "end": 161.333,
          "en": "step by step,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 161.333,
          "end": 164.03300000000002,
          "en": "which should be executed by the browser.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 164.03300000000002,
          "end": 165.433,
          "en": "Get access to the button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 165.433,
          "end": 166.966,
          "en": "get access to the input element,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 166.966,
          "end": 168.86599999999999,
          "en": "get access to the list element,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 168.86599999999999,
          "end": 170.466,
          "en": "create a function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 170.466,
          "end": 173.4,
          "en": "add a click event handler to the button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 173.4,
          "end": 176.36599999999999,
          "en": "and execute this function of a click occurs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 176.36599999999999,
          "end": 177.933,
          "en": "And in that function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 177.933,
          "end": 179.6,
          "en": "get access to the entered value,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 179.6,
          "end": 181.266,
          "en": "create a list item element,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 181.266,
          "end": 182.866,
          "en": "add the text content,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 182.866,
          "end": 184.466,
          "en": "append this list item,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 184.466,
          "end": 186,
          "en": "clear the value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 186,
          "end": 186.966,
          "en": "You see a pattern?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 186.966,
          "end": 189.36599999999999,
          "en": "We define every single step.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 189.36599999999999,
          "end": 192.266,
          "en": "With Vue, we have a totally different approach.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 192.266,
          "end": 196.766,
          "en": "There, we define the desired end result,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 196.766,
          "end": 200.133,
          "en": "and the data we will need in our Vue app,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 200.133,
          "end": 203.166,
          "en": "and we will leave it up to Vue to figure out",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 203.166,
          "end": 207.2,
          "en": "what needs to be created or added or changed in the Dom",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 207.2,
          "end": 208.666,
          "en": "at which point of time.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 209.566,
          "end": 211.9,
          "en": "And for that, we need to create a view app,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 211.9,
          "end": 215.233,
          "en": "which takes control over our HTML code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 215.233,
          "end": 217.333,
          "en": "And we do this by calling Vue,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 217.333,
          "end": 220.36599999999999,
          "en": "which is a global object that is available,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 220.36599999999999,
          "end": 222.433,
          "en": "thanks to our view CDN import,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 223.333,
          "end": 224.4,
          "en": "Vue.createApp.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 226.53300000000002,
          "end": 228.8,
          "en": "So this global Vue object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 228.8,
          "end": 230.566,
          "en": "we can call createApp.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 231.733,
          "end": 234.833,
          "en": "CreateApp takes an object, a JavaScript object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 234.833,
          "end": 238.1,
          "en": "where we configure this Vue app.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 238.1,
          "end": 239.733,
          "en": "And when I say configure,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 239.733,
          "end": 242.7,
          "en": "I mean things like setting up which kind of data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 242.7,
          "end": 244.733,
          "en": "we will use in our Vue app.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 244.733,
          "end": 246.5,
          "en": "For example, in this demo,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 246.5,
          "end": 249.36599999999999,
          "en": "I plan on working with a list of goals.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 249.36599999999999,
          "end": 253.5,
          "en": "So one piece of data which we'll need is that list of goals.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 253.5,
          "end": 255.466,
          "en": "Another piece of data which we'll need",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 255.466,
          "end": 257.666,
          "en": "is what the user entered here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 257.666,
          "end": 262.166,
          "en": "And we define that data by adding a data property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 262.166,
          "end": 265.033,
          "en": "to this object we pass to createApp,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 265.033,
          "end": 267.266,
          "en": "and this has to be called data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 268.1,
          "end": 271.1,
          "en": "It actually holds a function as a value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 271.1,
          "end": 273.266,
          "en": "and therefore in modern JavaScript,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 273.266,
          "end": 274.966,
          "en": "we can also write it like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 274.966,
          "end": 276.56600000000003,
          "en": "which is the exact same.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 276.56600000000003,
          "end": 278.266,
          "en": "A property named data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 278.266,
          "end": 280.866,
          "en": "which has a function as a value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 280.866,
          "end": 283.866,
          "en": "This function must return an object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 283.866,
          "end": 284.966,
          "en": "And in this object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 284.966,
          "end": 288.4,
          "en": "we can then define the data our Vue app should be aware of.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 288.4,
          "end": 289.533,
          "en": "As a side note,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 289.533,
          "end": 291.633,
          "en": "if this is a bit too fast for you,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 291.633,
          "end": 292.466,
          "en": "no worries.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 292.466,
          "end": 295.5,
          "en": "We'll walk through all the basics in greater depth",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 295.5,
          "end": 297.033,
          "en": "in the next module.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 297.033,
          "end": 299.06600000000003,
          "en": "This year is just a quick overview,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 299.06600000000003,
          "end": 301.133,
          "en": "which is why I'm not diving super deep",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 301.133,
          "end": 303.133,
          "en": "into all these concepts at the moment.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 303.133,
          "end": 306.666,
          "en": "We'll definitely do that in the next section though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 306.666,
          "end": 308.5,
          "en": "So we need to return an object here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 308.5,
          "end": 309.633,
          "en": "And in here, we can simply",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 309.633,
          "end": 312.333,
          "en": "add the data we wanna manage in this app.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 312.333,
          "end": 313.666,
          "en": "This would be a goals array,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 313.666,
          "end": 317.033,
          "en": "which initially is empty as a key value pair,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 317.033,
          "end": 318.6,
          "en": "and the entered value,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 318.6,
          "end": 320.366,
          "en": "which initially is an empty string.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 321.3,
          "end": 323.33299999999997,
          "en": "And now these two pieces of data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 323.33299999999997,
          "end": 327.533,
          "en": "are pieces of data Vue is aware of.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 327.533,
          "end": 330.166,
          "en": "And that will become important later.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 330.166,
          "end": 333.3,
          "en": "Now we can connect this entered value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 333.3,
          "end": 334.966,
          "en": "with this input",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 334.966,
          "end": 339.8,
          "en": "by adding a special so-called directive on the input,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 339.8,
          "end": 342.3,
          "en": "a special HTML attribute.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 342.3,
          "end": 346.666,
          "en": "And that would be the V-model attribute.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 346.666,
          "end": 350.633,
          "en": "That's not a default attribute, which is supported by HTML.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 350.633,
          "end": 353.5,
          "en": "This will only be understood by Vue.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 353.5,
          "end": 355.033,
          "en": "And as a value,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 355.033,
          "end": 357.6,
          "en": "we repeat the name of this property,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 357.6,
          "end": 358.633,
          "en": "entered value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 359.83299999999997,
          "end": 361.6,
          "en": "This will establish a connection",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
